<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tab. <a href="#A3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ C.2 Jailbreaking Large Language Models ‣ Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Activation Steering with a Feedback Controller" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reports a comprehensive comparison of attack success rate (ASR) and general benchmark performance across multiple instruction-tuned models under different defense methods. Overall, PID consistently achieves the highest ASR among defenses, while maintaining comparable performance on downstream benchmarks.</p>
</div>
